WEBVTT

1
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:14,410
Mou Chuan is such a white-eyed wolf with an unfamiliar stomach. We saved his life.

2
00:00:14,530 --> 00:00:16,370
He didn't even say a word to anyone, so he went there

3
00:00:17,420 --> 00:00:18,380
The one who saves the world

4
00:00:18,660 --> 00:00:19,860
Still dreaming of saving the world

5
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:24,530
It's time for him to wake up after he's had enough holes and stomachaches outside.

6
00:00:24,650 --> 00:00:49,500
We'll set up camp here for now

7
00:00:49,620 --> 00:00:50,740
Build a house for shelter

8
00:00:51,300 --> 00:00:52,620
Wait until we get through this storm

9
00:00:52,860 --> 00:00:54,780
Snowflakes will be sent back from Changchang
